      <div class="ds-pricing">
        <article class="ds-price featured"><h3>Community</h3><strong>Free</strong><p>Open-source scanner, local CLI, GitHub Actions and optional bring-your-own AI key.</p><a href="https://github.com/mabrig1/mabrig-devshield-ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Use free DevShield ↗</a></article>
        <article class="ds-price"><h3>Solo <small>Planned</small></h3><strong>$19 <span>/mo</span></strong><p>Target: managed reviews and personal security reporting.</p><a href="mailto:mabrig@mabrigkorie.org?subject=DevShield%20Solo%20Interest">Join early access ↗</a></article>
        <article class="ds-price"><h3>Pro <small>Planned</small></h3><strong>$59 <span>/mo</span></strong><p>Target: multi-repository reporting, security policy packs and analytics.</p><a href="mailto:mabrig@mabrigkorie.org?subject=DevShield%20Pro%20Interest">Join early access ↗</a></article>
        <article class="ds-price"><h3>Team <small>Planned</small></h3><strong>$149 <span>/mo</span></strong><p>Target: organization policies, shared reporting and audit records.</p><a href="mailto:mabrig@mabrigkorie.org?subject=DevShield%20Team%20Interest">Join early access ↗</a></article>
        <article class="ds-price"><h3>Business <small>Planned</small></h3><strong>$399 <span>/mo</span></strong><p>Target: advanced governance, onboarding and high-usage reporting.</p><a href="mailto:mabrig@mabrigkorie.org?subject=DevShield%20Business%20Interest">Join early access ↗</a></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ds-section ds-alt" id="services">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head"><div class="eyebrow">Professional services</div><h2>Get hands-on security support</h2></div>
      <div class="ds-service-grid">
        <div><strong>$99</strong><h3>Launch Setup</h3><p>Up to three repositories, Action configuration, SARIF and policy tuning.</p></div>
        <div><strong>$299</strong><h3>Security Hardening Sprint</h3><p>Up to ten repositories, policy review and prioritized remediation guidance.</p></div>
        <div><strong>$750</strong><h3>Team Rollout</h3><p>Shared policy and training across up to 25 repositories.</p></div>
      </div>
      <p class="ds-note">Service availability and project scope are confirmed individually before engagement.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ds-section ds-contact">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="ds-kicker">SECURE THE NEXT RELEASE</div>
      <h2>Build with confidence. Ship with evidence.</h2>
      <p>Request implementation support or join the commercial API early-access list.</p>
      <div class="ds-actions">
        <a href="mailto:mabrig@mabrigkorie.org?subject=MABRIG%20DevShield%20Consultation" class="btn btn-primary">Talk to MABRIG Technologies</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/mabrig1/mabrig-devshield-ai/tree/main/commercial-api" class="btn btn-ghost" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View API Documentation ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
